: Category GMV growth, Jan–Aug 2018 vs Jan–Aug 2017 (categories with ≥R$20k base)","tag":"Vega-Lite","blocks":[{"t":"chart","title":"Category GMV growth, Jan–Aug 2018 vs Jan–Aug 2017 (categories with ≥R$20k base)","spec":{"mark":"bar","encoding":{"y":{"field":"product_category","type":"nominal","sort":"-x","title":null},"x":{"field":"growth","type":"quantitative","axis":{"format":".0%"},"title":"GMV growth YoY"},"tooltip":[{"field":"product_category"},{"field":"gmv_2017","format":",.0f"},{"field":"gmv_2018","format":",.0f"},{"field":"growth","format":".0%"}]}},"rows":[{"product_category":"baby","gmv_2017":70328.5700000002,"gmv_2018":256086.69999999792,"growth":2.6412897347407633,"abs_change":185758.12999999773},{"product_category":"stationery","gmv_2017":37276.560000000114,"gmv_2018":135468.71999999936,"growth":2.6341529368589525,"abs_change":98192.15999999925},{"product_category":"watches_gifts","gmv_2017":206284.43999999925,"gmv_2018":708305.9500000053,"growth":2.433637311665426,"abs_change":502021.51000000606},{"product_category":"electronics","gmv_2017":29614.230000000127,"gmv_2018":101000.3899999998,"growth":2.410535745822173,"abs_change":71386.15999999967},{"product_category":"health_beauty","gmv_2017":247457.94999999812,"gmv_2018":770002.8100000046,"growth":2.111651131030587,"abs_change":522544.8600000065},{"product_category":"housewares","gmv_2017":131132.60999999946,"gmv_2018":397688.0599999999,"growth":2.0327167285086563,"abs_change":266555.4500000004},{"product_category":"telephony","gmv_2017":60745.02000000007,"gmv_2018":179751.54000000036,"growth":1.9591156608393603,"abs_change":119006.52000000028},{"product_category":"musical_instruments","gmv_2017":37431.40000000005,"gmv_2018":107746.07999999974,"growth":1.8784945259861932,"abs_change":70314.67999999969},{"product_category":"auto","gmv_2017":128278.05999999978,"gmv_2018":346632.4400000002,"growth":1.7021958392573193,"abs_change":218354.3800000004},{"product_category":"pet_shop","gmv_2017":49750.29000000011,"gmv_2018":128053.23999999995,"growth":1.5739194686101259,"abs_change":78302.94999999984},{"product_category":"sports_leisure","gmv_2017":224596.74999999788,"gmv_2018":530182.1800000053,"growth":1.3605959569762711,"abs_change":305585.4300000074},{"product_category":"computers_accessories","gmv_2017":219638.67999999798,"gmv_2018":502432.0900000063,"growth":1.2875391984690991,"abs_change":282793.4100000083}]}]}],"answer":"I measured growth as category GMV in Jan–Aug 2018 against the same months of 2017. On that basis, **baby (+264%)** and **stationery (+263%)** grew fastest [3]. Watches & gifts and health & beauty added the most money.\n\n| Category | 2017 GMV (R$) | 2018 GMV (R$) | Growth |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| baby | 70k | 256k | +264% |\n| stationery | 37k | 135k | +263% |\n| watches_gifts | 206k | 708k | +243% |\n| electronics | 30k | 101k | +241% |\n| health_beauty | 247k | 770k | +211% |\n\n- All categories together grew **138%** [4]. So sports_leisure (+136%) and computers_accessories (+129%) only kept pace with the marketplace [3].\n\nCaveats: data ends in Aug 2018. I left out categories with under R$20k in 2017 GMV, because growth from a tiny base looks huge.","model":"claude-opus-5-5","role":"analyst","source":"olist","at":"2026-10-12T01:46:43.005Z","secs":19,"usage":{"in":15415,"out":1676,"cache":18237}}]}